# Step 1: Analysis («Бизнес и сценарии»)
Input: issue. Output: section on the epic/feature page.
- New page from the template; add to sidebar; issue «Связи» gets the link.
- Write: goal, users/roles, scenarios (simple example first), in/out of scope, constraints, open questions.
- Feature: concrete scenarios + testable Given/When/Then criteria. Epic: business goal, end-to-end scenarios, no field detail.
- Do not design the solution. Disagreement: step 3.
